(Thanks, Simona. We delivered a strong quarter driven by record revenue in both Data Center and) Tj
T*
( Gaming with strong fundamentals and execution against a challenging macro backdrop. Total ) Tj
T*
(revenue of $8.3 billion was a record, up 8% sequentially and up 46% year on year. Data Center ) Tj
T*
(has become our largest market platform, and we see continued strong momentum going forward.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Starting with Gaming. Revenue of $3.6 billion rose 6% sequentially and 31% year on year, ) Tj
T*
(powered by the GeForce RTX 30 Series product cycle. Since launching in the fall of 2020, the ) Tj
T*
(RTX 30 Series has been our best Gaming product cycle ever. The gaming industry has grown ) Tj
T*
(tremendously with 100 million new PC gamers added in the past two years according to Newzoo.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(And NVIDIA RTX has set new standard for the industry with demand from both first-time GPU ) Tj
T*
(buyers as well as those upgrading their PCs to experience the 250-plus RTX-optimized games and) Tj
T*
( apps, double from last year. We estimate that almost a third of the GeForce Gaming GPU ) Tj
T*
(installed base is now on RTX. RTX has brought tremendous energy into the gaming world, and has) Tj
T*
( helped drive a sustained expansion in our higher-end platforms and installed base with ) Tj
T*
(significant runway still ahead. Overall, end demand remained solid though mixed by region, and) Tj
T*
( demand in America's remained strong.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(However, we started seeing softness in parts of Europe related to the war in the Ukraine and ) Tj
T*
(parts of China due to the COVID lockdowns. As we expect some ongoing impact as we prepare for ) Tj
T*
(a new architectural transition later in the year, we are projecting Gaming revenue to decline ) Tj
T*
(sequentially in Q2. Channel inventory has nearly normalized and we expect it to remain around ) Tj
T*
(these levels in Q2. The extent in which cryptocurrency mining contributed to Gaming demand is ) Tj
T*
(difficult for us to quantify with any reasonable degree of precision.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The reduced pace of increase in Ethereum network hash rate likely reflects lower mining ) Tj
T*
(activity on GPUs. We expect a diminishing contribution going forward. Laptop Gaming revenue ) Tj
T*
(posted strong sequential and year-on-year growth, driven by the ramp of the NVIDIA RTX 30 ) Tj
T*
(Series lineup. With this year's spring refresh and ahead of the upcoming back-to-school ) Tj
T*
(season, there are now over 180 laptop models featuring RTX 30 Series GPUs and our energy-) Tj
T*
(efficient thin and light Max-Q technologies, up from 140 at this time last year.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Driving this growth are not just gamers, but also the fast-growing category of content ) Tj
T*
(creators from whom we offer dedicated NVIDIA studio drivers. We've also developed applications) Tj
T*
( and tools to empower artists from Omniverse for advanced 3D and collaboration to broadcast ) Tj
T*
(for live streaming to canvas for painting landscapes with AI. The creator economy is estimated) Tj
T*
( at $100 billion and powered by 80 million individual creators and broadcasters. We continued ) Tj
T*
(to build out our GeForce NOW cloud gaming service.) Tj
