T*
(plans of $19.99 a month. We added over 100 games to the GeForce NOW library, bringing the ) Tj
T*
(total to over 1,300 games. And last week, we launched Fortnite on GeForce NOW with touch ) Tj
T*
(controls for mobile devices, streaming through the Safari web browser on iOS and the GeForce ) Tj
